  m_Name: Irina Kuznetsova
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PassengerData
  passengerName: Irina Kuznetsova
  portrait: {fileID: 6937817954938267909, guid: 6bcd3a7c7fdf97a41b192aecb3b00903, type: 3}
  healthPoints: 3
  charDescription: "Irina Kuznetsova is an unremarkable thirty year old woman who
    travel under a false name and in the compagny of her \u201Chusband\u201D, a huge
    guy named Yakiv Myronenko. Quite discreet, she wear nice clothes and often has
    to isolate herself, behind the excuse of a train sickness. Her husband is very
    protective, but they seem not really close, they do not touch each other or even
    kiss. Her real name is Nataliya Honcharova, a famous singer who, since the ennemy
    has taken the capital, was \"strongly encouraged\" to sing for the leaders of
    the occupying army. She choose to flee, with her bodyguard Andriy, and uses make-up
    and wiggs to stay incognito. Talking with her reveal a kind and cultivated woman,
    who might if she feel safe untertain other with her beautiful voice [ \xE0 voir
    si on garde ou pas ce c\xF4t\xE9 l\xE0 ]."
  bonus:
  - incognito
  - entertainer
  - toujours a deux
  inkJSON: {fileID: 0}
